#compdef caller

# Print the location of call-stack frame N (bash's `caller`).
#
# zshrs builtin. builtin_caller (src/extensions/ext_builtins.rs) takes no
# options and reads one optional numeric frame depth (default 0, a
# non-number counts as 0) indexing $funcstack. The depth is a free number:
# $funcstack at completion time is the completer's own stack, not the one
# `caller` will see.
# Bundled into ~/.zshrs/functions by build.rs.

_arguments '1::frame depth (0 is the current frame):'
